    <string name="steam_warning_title">Claim on Steam automatically?</string>
    <string name="steam_warning_text">The Steam Subscriber Agreement (4.C) forbids scripts and bots, and Valve may restrict the account without notice. The app goes slowly on purpose (one game per run, 20 minutes apart, 6 a day at most), checks the base game of a DLC first and only uses the free licence form. The risk is yours.</string>
