    <string name="set_background">Also with the screen off</string>
    <string name="background_title">Claim with the screen off?</string>
    <string name="background_text">During each background check, the app opens the store page itself, invisibly, and claims what is left — the same engine as on screen, one game at a time, ten minutes at most.\n\nIf a store asks for a human check (captcha), the app never solves it: a notification calls you, and one tap finishes that game on screen.\n\nA discreet notification shows while it works. Nothing else leaves the phone.</string>
